# lattice
# a bine
# left by the builder of bine, 30 September 2026
# Five stems that flower in spring: violet, blue, white, pink and dark red. Broad, slow, and
# busy at every height. Its colours come round again, if you wait long enough.
kind: bine
stems: violet blue white pink dark-red
habit: 2 4 -1 -3
reach: 14
flowers: spring
coat: smooth
hardy: -15
